{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15301294","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15301294","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1530129401:0":{"text":"Not at all! Look closer. See the red stains?","source_cn":"不不不，这可不贵！你仔细看看，看到了吗？上面的红色！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x274C8F94DA90BF6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1530129402:0":{"text":"That's Halian blood all over it!","source_cn":"——这上面沾满了呼临人的血！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85DE30CDAEE59CA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1530129403:0":{"text":"Really? Let me see!","source_cn":"真的？给我看看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC8E5B74D18025F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1530129404:1":{"text":"So that's why you're asking so much.","source_cn":"原来是这样，难怪你敢要这么高的价。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE7085DFD1997A0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1530129405:1":{"text":"I'll think about it. One boar can feed me for nearly a week...","source_cn":"我考虑一下要不要吧。毕竟一整只野猪可是我四五天的口粮呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA335927A5E0F19C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","docume